    "Scanned %@: %@" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver announcement after the camera reads a barcode. The arguments are its format, then the code, as in “Scanned EAN-13: 5012345678900”. The format's name is already translated and may contain the word code, as QR Code and Code 128 do, so do not add one.",
